---
source: tests/sync/patch_cargo_toml.rs
expression: "apply(PKG, &patch)"
---
## Input

```toml
[package]
name = "x"
version = "0.1"
```

## Patch

```
deps:
  - napi@3 features=["napi6"] require_features=["node"]
```

## Output

```toml
[package]
name = "x"
version = "0.1"

[dependencies]
napi = { version = "3", features = ["napi6"], optional = true }

[features]
node = ["dep:napi"]
```
